          drift backwards as you tire. It suits finding out whether steep
          walking suits you before you spend thousands. (The same listing
          said 40% when we first checked it on 6 November 2026 and was
          corrected to 32% by 28 November.)
        </p>
        <p>
          A powered incline trainer is the other end of the scale. Our guide
          to <a href="/how-much-does-an-incline-trainer-cost/" class="text-[#0F62FE] font-medium">how much an incline trainer costs</a>
          puts a powered home machine at about $2,875 to $4,299 in November
